== diags.diag/input-body-nested-diagnostic
BYN1017 4:8 parentheses around a condition are an input form
  label not needed
  help remove the parentheses
  fix 4:8-4:55 a { unless b { print("s") } else { print("t") } }
BYN1006 4:36 `unless` cannot have an `else` branch
  label `else` after `unless`
  help use `if` with the opposite condition, so both branches read positively
BYN1018 4:12 the body of `if` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
